NOTICE — exam content
=====================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the source code of this project only.

UPSC Combined Defence Services question papers, and any answer keys published by
third parties, remain the property of their respective rights holders. They are
not distributed in this repository:

  - pdfs/                      source exam PDFs, gitignored
  - scripts/ocr_text/          OCR transcriptions of those PDFs, gitignored
  - answer_keys/*.jpg|png|pdf  third-party answer-key images, gitignored

Obtain them yourself from the original sources. pdfs/_manifest.json lists the
expected filenames. See README.md for the data pipeline.

The derived question bank (src/data/questions.json) is included so the app runs
out of the box. Only 110 of its 427 questions originate from a UPSC paper; the
other 317 were written by hand and are stamped with a year and session they have
no connection to. Only 38 answers trace to an external answer key. See the
answer-accuracy section in README.md before relying on any of it.

